In conclusion, living in Flagstaff and Kaneohe has been both rewarding and challenging. While there are certainly upsides to each location, I am grateful for the unique experiences that have shaped me into the person I am today. Whether I choose to stay in either place, I know that I will carry those memories with me forever.
